algorithms.pseudocode:
function hamming_distance(r1, r2):
  return |{i : r1[i] != r2[i]}|

function substitution_neighbors(r, m):
  for each slot i, for each value v != r[i]:
    yield r with r[i] = v

function shortest_path(r1, r2):
  path = [r1]
  for i where r1[i] != r2[i]:
    current[i] = r2[i]
    path.append(current)
  return path
